<title>UK: UK's ICI sees H1 profit of 160 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>UK's ICI sees H1 profit of 160 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Imperial Chemical Industries Plc (ICI) said on Monday it expected 1997 first half pre-tax profits of 160 million pounds ($270.4 million), before exceptional items.</p>
<p>ICI said earlier on Monday it had agreed to sell  polyester polymer, titanium dioxide and 'Melinex' polyester film businesses to DuPont Co for three billion dollars.</p>
